    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea52fb0f81dd958e4e71dcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是下一场比赛很快就要来了呢。\n秋古马三冠的最后一战『有马纪念』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b17d1d2c2d91f541ac1089f9ec702a4c92181f115ef23757fe58d48869e5b4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
