    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50c6d5aba9c87bce66180cc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有，更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70619c094cd5568f723e20f43a24a387b1f392402b28078a021f8e456bfd3b20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae28812ca648852675eab0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业是骨子里的创作者。\n甚至能为了作品，\n做出关乎自己人生的抉择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e77b8e56c2ddfd8f8d137f48b07f2e77a1598c0739a94bc70fc21648cb6e2534",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d1aeb88bc4cb66b2f0bed7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "739c58af48fdf0744db8ff6ca138de8f3d036710dd60d4e8f6354a00a0683da7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3ab60441551874ca5f9a209",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我理解她的主张。\n如果这就是她所期望的，那也无妨。\n正当我想这么说时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d033348fa2390d98a03c5968a10d22f5aedac4db8c931f2842ab36d74d7633",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afeb3953b8c7cecf57202900",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "死也不要！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e270a49cedf4079962ac2c50dcc94819241028a65db33bd92821d8711551246",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e75fe5c10d899f067ee4e9ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业",
      "source_fingerprint": "724792a2e3d296c7611773ef019203633319ea51a39af196ebd8de8dbc3c2a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
