      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bede364f4a51354a112b3698",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed36c9675dd6893085ba6214a490a503a368d34d16f15d7a457c4bf80c8c5607",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8404b5ebbda88f2eb3bf7b18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我走近神业，\n夺过她藏在身后的平板。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03c3fd0fe9e7ffb39fcea6baf3292b1486ae3fb59ab775bd57b5a86e22e9714",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be5ba2c0bdbb0edc3df7ad0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天在东京比赛场看到神业的时候，\n她似乎用平板――在画着什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1692c5713f1d554b6fd7266cda9c8a74c5b4c529df1d4b931225a49933a66896",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1330d3f48dfcfc76f1eaa4eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――果不其然，\n上面显示的是正在画着的漫画。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9af0f419dbb729880d8c1a23167f2673e64f988c3574a8a795424f8142dc2d05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b812d92cb1d77dbda3d79e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业",
      "source_fingerprint": "724792a2e3d296c7611773ef019203633319ea51a39af196ebd8de8dbc3c2a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea744971488d3c9b5157862",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（要来个能让新的读者和老粉丝\n都满意的大团圆结局！　然后――）\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "21befacff2d5ef0080747edfcf4cd0c6e9f3894a00fd9d7f23d7858fa511812a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0869c102aba79c63bc719d25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的漫画不是还在连载吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c888995fb1947de1d36023b2d1718649e8f921c5a16d4528e1ee76f84ec22900",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb842329fe2e0864c370f51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的漫画不是还在连载吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c888995fb1947de1d36023b2d1718649e8f921c5a16d4528e1ee76f84ec22900",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dca526282f0bf986021db535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然有些地方被涂黑了，\n也有画到一半就中断的分镜。\n即使如此――",
